{"date":"2025-03-14","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_c4ea00d2191adfc204ac11085d43dad0","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1741944600,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-03-11","chunk":0,"id":"m_1f920a71c255b41833422386c26c0e59"}}},{"id":"m_9d50f90f29ca5768fc11ab74f5bf8523","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1741944637,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_9881371e98fe86c3e0c1c8177378ffe2","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1741944674,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_60efc6f97fc7b840ded37d3fdd55bfe6","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1741944711,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_64d8b94d7ee37c29861838638b9578c5","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1741944748,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5262c58f524e680961cf68ccc524834b","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1741944785,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_fc2f78435045d954ea31fb6b516fcf02","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1741944822,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_ab7fda30a5c2cf8c5231433c267eeb8c","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1741944859,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c77d803bc6083a5e71af6a007981f3ab","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1741944896,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_dd339240e2dd5f56b7758eeb28415a3d","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1741944933,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_550acb4e066b3e2cc1fc0f0ff268cc29","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1741944970,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_d97ac20bed5b71ddb4680a01f8827b2f","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1741945007,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7945d3c057eff3cfb4eab40c59a346dd","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1741945044,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e01a257474b0354cdf8c212e6120f7a0","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1741945081,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ba79978fa770e0d2c71cc279c6bc7543","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1741945118,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_a40a623402bb699e042d4f48a4443183","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1741945155,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_a0255820fee3323a7bb7dc6a6dcf1283","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1741945192,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_70590717e395274ae4e7cae13781300f","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1741945229,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_68183519f76d616752acc701dc67b6ad","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1741945266,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b551255229c150877e5a9f18e3b9ef66","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1741945303,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2adfa88dbf47c4c82441cf5f82a3c038","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1741945340,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_56e5b36db1debcd6976bd0dc17ac97b0","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1741945377,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1447b3652ea79cfb553850185301800b","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1741945414,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_683a9959b685b823c4c8f5d1b8278dc0","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1741945451,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
